        "jsCode": "// Copy the uploaded photo binary from the form trigger onto this item as 'data'\nconst formItem = $('On form submission').first();\nconst binary = (formItem && formItem.binary) || {};\nconst keys = Object.keys(binary);\nconst out = { json: $json };\nif (keys.length > 0) {\n  out.binary = { data: binary[keys[0]] };\n}\nreturn [out];"
